      "role": "user",
      "content": "I hear you, but I'm worried we're missing something. Sometimes people mask personal issues behind \"differing priorities.\" Did you pick up on anything during your sessions that suggests this isn't just about the budget? Like, any personal friction or specific complaints about leadership styles that might be fueling this? I need to know if we're dealing with a personality clash before I sign off on this settlement.",
